\ Fixture exercised by `make aot-line-directives-check` to verify that
\ AOT-emitted C carries `#line` directives at word and quotation
\ function entries. The user word and inline quotation below are the
\ minimum surface needed for the assertion script.

double: ( n -- n ) [ 2 * ] ;

5 double .
3 [ "tick" print-line ] times
